[ceiling] Each flat pull roof is a hand-contact face spanning 16 by 9.75 mm at Z272.194, including the 0.25 mm supported-face allowance from `pull_z_span`. The current native bench-fit slice has one bed-rooted support body and one interface in each open outer pocket, with 105.84 mm build-up. The left support leaves straight toward −X and the right support toward +X, through their exposed mouths before pumps are installed. `pump-toolpath-review.json` identifies the exact G-code and locates both interfaces inside these openings; `pump-support-audit.md` records the lanes. Physical removal effort and contact finish remain unmeasured.
